              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "DeAnn Pressley"
            },
            "reviewBody": "A good basic recipe, added lots more of all stated ingredients, plus as another reviewer suggested, thyme, oregano, basil, onion, and about a tablespoon of butter. Next time I'll add some white wine to the sauce. With my additions, there's enough left for dinner tomorrow night, which will equal 4 servings as the main course. I'm looking forward to seeing, as one reviewer said, whether it's better the second night!",
